1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,880
Fast thumbs make messy text.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,404
Typosaurus fixes it in one tap.

3
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:08,425
Eight AI shortcuts rephrase, translate or reply.

4
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:11,975
Or type /fix, and the text is rewritten in place.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:14,340
Bring your own key from five providers.

6
00:00:14,550 --> 00:00:16,590
Reorder the shortcuts, or add your own.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:19,035
There's an emoji panel, and voice typing.

8
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:22,795
Pick your toolbar, theme, accent color, haptics and key height.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,805
The home screen walks you through setup.

10
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:28,935
Typosaurus. The AI keyboard that eats typos.
